{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.LusztigVsHermitianBar","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.LusztigVsHermitianBar","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Normed.Field.Basic"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LusztigVsHermitianBar.lusztig_eq_hermitian_on_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LusztigVsHermitianBar.lusztig_eq_hermitian_on_real","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lusztig-vs-hermitian-bar.lean#L39-L44","doc":"Specialization: on `q ∈ ℝ` (viewed in `ℂ`), Lusztig and\nHermitian agree on the parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LusztigVsHermitianBar.lusztig_eq_hermitian_iff_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LusztigVsHermitianBar.lusztig_eq_hermitian_iff_real","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lusztig-vs-hermitian-bar.lean#L27-L37","doc":"For nonzero `q : ℂ`, the Lusztig involution `q ↦ q⁻¹` and the\nHermitian involution `q ↦ (conj q)⁻¹` agree on the parameter\niff `q ∈ ℝ` (i.e. `q.im = 0`). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:lusztig-vs-hermitian-bar","label":"prop:lusztig-vs-hermitian-bar","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lusztig-vs-hermitian-bar.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}